  "capi_no_consumer_path_1037_real_writes": {
    "test": "zig build capi-contract-test -Dtest-filter=\"no-consumer path 1037\" (pkg/antfly-embedded/src/capi/lite_connection.zig), the one no-consumer measurement that does exercise the Owner layer this round's retirement/certificate changes touch -- 1,037 single-document inserts through the real public C API batch path, live Owner.worker, no registered consumer (index/enrichment/source/ttl/resolver)",
